{{!--
    Shortcuts, for testing: the player never sees these. Add #shortcuts to the address of the
    published page (effects.js goes to this section), or use --start shortcuts on the command line.

    Each one starts where a single click plays the moment, on a Victoria line train that has just
    left Stockwell, with nothing else having happened.
--}}

[[shortcuts]]:
@clear
{{!-- squiffy-ignore squiffy/unreachable-section --}}
Shortcuts:

- [[Getting on at Balham]](shortcut, to = "Balham"): the page goes up, two clicks in
- [[Leaving my usual train]](shortcut, to = "escape at Stockwell"): the page goes left
- [[Meeting Heather]](shortcut, to = "Heather"): her name, everywhere
- [[Blacking out]](shortcut, to = "pale"): speckles, and black
- [[HEATHER]](shortcut, to = "HEATHER"): her name goes by like a train
- [[The way home]](shortcut, to = "empty hope"): everything goes by like a train
- [[The end]](shortcut, to = "one small thing"): the last photograph

[[shortcut]]:
@clear
{{!-- squiffy-ignore squiffy/unreachable-section --}}
@set escaped = "Stockwell"
@set station = "Stockwell"
@set line = "victoria"
@set direction = -1
@set t = 40
@set noticed = []
@set platforms = []
@set been = []
@set told = []
{{board}}{{goto to}}
